<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg" data-parallax="0.15"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Calculators</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Mississippi Owners</h1><p class="lede">Seven calculators and planners built from real appraisal questions. Check the carrier’s math, plan your deadlines and decide your next step — no sign-up, nothing stored.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards cards-3" data-stagger><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/appraisal-payoff-estimator/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Appraisal Payoff Estimator</h2><p>Size the disputed amount, test where an award might land and subtract realistic appraiser and umpire fees.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/holdback-recovery-calculator/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Holdback Recovery Calculator</h2><p>Split a replacement-cost claim into the first ACV check, the depreciation held back and the total after repairs.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares, bundles and eave footage — then compare against the carrier’s roof section.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/named-storm-deductible-calculator/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="639" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Named-Storm Deductible Calculator</h2><p>See a 1%–10% hurricane or named-storm deductible in real dollars and what a storm claim would actually pay.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/claim-calendar-builder/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calendar.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calendar-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calendar.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="615" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Planner</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Claim Calendar Builder</h2><p>Turn your date of loss into dated milestones — notice, proof of loss, holdback, appraisal windows — and export them.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Checklist</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before anyone demands appraisal.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card card-tool rv" href="/claim-calculator-suite/wind-water-split-estimator/"><span class="card-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-kind">Estimator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Wind vs. Water Split Estimator</h2><p>See how splitting coastal storm damage between wind and flood changes what each policy pays — and what’s left over.</p><span class="more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section><div class="wrap cols"><article class="prose"><h2>A sensible order</h2><ol>
<li>Protect your dates with the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/claim-calendar-builder/">claim calendar builder</a>.</li>
<li>Check roof math with the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">roof pitch &amp; squares calculator</a>.</li>
<li>On the Coast, test the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/wind-water-split-estimator/">wind vs. water split</a> and your <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/named-storm-deductible-calculator/">named-storm deductible</a>.</li>
<li>See how payments split with the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/holdback-recovery-calculator/">holdback recovery calculator</a>.</li>
<li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/appraisal-payoff-estimator/">appraisal payoff estimator</a>, then finish with the <a href="/claim-calculator-suite/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through first</h2><p>Free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> +1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm CT</small></div></div></aside></div><section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the carrier’s number is right?</h2><p>Send the estimate and a few photos. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
